#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Control and query the Apple keyboard monitor (apple-kb-monitord).\n"
"\n"
"The Fn mode is a parameter of the hid_apple kernel module: it applies to ALL "
"Apple keyboards connected to this computer, not to a single one. Changing it "
"requires administrator rights (polkit authentication)."
msgstr ""
"Styr och fråga Apple-tangentbordsövervakaren (apple-kb-monitord).\n"
"\n"
"Fn-läget är en parameter i kärnmodulen hid_apple: det gäller ALLA Apple-"
"tangentbord anslutna till den här datorn, inte bara ett. Att ändra det "
"kräver administratörsrättigheter (polkit-autentisering)."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"EXIT CODES:\n"
"  0   success\n"
"  1   error (D-Bus failure, write refused, bad data)\n"
"  2   daemon absent (apple-kb-monitord not on the session bus)\n"
"  64  usage error (invalid arguments)\n"
"\n"
"FN MODES (hid_apple.fnmode, global to every Apple keyboard):\n"
"  0  disabled   Fn key has no effect\n"
"  1  fkeyslast  media keys by default, Fn+Fx = F-key\n"
"  2  fkeysfirst F-keys by default, Fn+Fx = media key\n"
"  3  auto       kernel default: = 1 on an Apple keyboard\n"
"  4  fkeysdisabled F-keys disabled (media keys only)"
msgstr ""
"AVSLUTNINGSKODER:\n"
"  0   lyckades\n"
"  1   fel (D-Bus-fel, skrivning nekad, felaktiga data)\n"
"  2   tjänsten saknas (apple-kb-monitord inte på sessionsbussen)\n"
"  64  användningsfel (ogiltiga argument)\n"
"\n"
"FN-LÄGEN (hid_apple.fnmode, gemensamt för alla Apple-tangentbord):\n"
"  0  disabled   Fn-tangenten har ingen effekt\n"
"  1  fkeyslast  medietangenter som standard, Fn+Fx = F-tangent\n"
"  2  fkeysfirst F-tangenter som standard, Fn+Fx = medietangent\n"
"  3  auto       kärnans standard: = 1 på ett Apple-tangentbord\n"
"  4  fkeysdisabled F-tangenter inaktiverade (endast medietangenter)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print help (see more with '--help')"
msgstr "Visa hjälp (mer med '--help')"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print help (see a summary with '-h')"
msgstr "Visa hjälp (sammanfattning med '-h')"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print version"
msgstr "Visa version"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show keyboard state (battery, connection, RSSI, Fn mode)"
msgstr "Visa tangentbordets tillstånd (batteri, anslutning, RSSI, Fn-läge)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Machine-readable JSON (schema 1) on a single line"
msgstr "Maskinläsbar JSON (schema 1) på en rad"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print help"
msgstr "Visa hjälp"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Read a setting"
msgstr "Läs en inställning"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Current Fn mode (0-4), read from /sys/module/hid_apple/parameters/fnmode"
msgstr ""
"Aktuellt Fn-läge (0-4), läst från /sys/module/hid_apple/parameters/fnmode"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "hid_apple parameters (all of them, or one)"
msgstr "hid_apple-parametrar (alla eller en)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)"
msgstr "Visa det här meddelandet eller hjälpen för angivna underkommandon"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Change a setting (administrator authentication required)"
msgstr "Ändra en inställning (administratörsautentisering krävs)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Set the Fn mode of hid_apple (0-4). Global to ALL Apple keyboards; asks for "
"administrator authentication through polkit (pkexec akm-helper)"
msgstr ""
"Ställ in Fn-läget för hid_apple (0-4). Gemensamt för ALLA Apple-tangentbord; "
"begär administratörsautentisering via polkit (pkexec akm-helper)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "0 disabled, 1 fkeyslast, 2 fkeysfirst, 3 auto, 4 fkeysdisabled"
msgstr "0 disabled, 1 fkeyslast, 2 fkeysfirst, 3 auto, 4 fkeysdisabled"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Also write it to /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf so it survives reboots"
msgstr ""
"Skriv det även till /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf så att det överlever "
"omstarter"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Set a hid_apple parameter (fnmode 0-4, iso_layout -1..1, swap_opt_cmd 0-2, "
"swap_ctrl_cmd 0-1, swap_fn_leftctrl 0-1). Global to ALL Apple keyboards"
msgstr ""
"Ställ in en hid_apple-parameter (fnmode 0-4, iso_layout -1..1, swap_opt_cmd "
"0-2, swap_ctrl_cmd 0-1, swap_fn_leftctrl 0-1). Gemensamt för ALLA Apple-"
"tangentbord"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Also write it to /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf"
msgstr "Skriv det även till /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Rename the keyboard on this computer (BlueZ alias; nothing is written into "
"the keyboard). With --device-name: the name stored IN the keyboard"
msgstr ""
"Byt namn på tangentbordet på den här datorn (BlueZ-alias; inget skrivs till "
"tangentbordet). Med --device-name: namnet som lagras I tangentbordet"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"TWO NAMES:\n"
"  akmctl rename <name>                 alias of THIS computer (BlueZ Alias): "
"nothing written into the keyboard\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name <name>   WRITES the name stored IN the "
"keyboard (seen by every host):\n"
"                                       pre-flight, backup of the current "
"name, ONE confirmation [y/N]\n"
"                                       (--yes skips it and works without a "
"terminal), one write, immediate\n"
"                                       read-back, verdict. No password in "
"the active local session.\n"
"                                       --check: whole pre-flight and backup, "
"nothing written, nothing asked\n"
"                                       --dry-run: shows the bytes, no "
"pkexec, nothing written\n"
"                                       --verbose: frames, wire bytes, proof, "
"[devname] journal\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --show   name stored in the keyboard, from the "
"daemon's cache\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --restore <backup.json> [--yes]   write a "
"backup back (same flow)\n"
"Exit codes of --device-name: 0 written and read back identical (or --check "
"green), 10 no terminal and\n"
"no --yes, 11 pre-flight refused, 12 cancelled, 13 written but not read back "
"(check with --show),\n"
"14 read back different (rollback command printed), 15 write uncertain (the "
"write failed on its way:\n"
"a frame may have been sent, check with --show). Persistence across a battery "
"change is not measured\n"
"(docs/RENAME-KEYBOARD.md)."
msgstr ""
"TVÅ NAMN:\n"
"  akmctl rename <namn>                 alias på DEN HÄR datorn (BlueZ "
"Alias): inget skrivs till tangentbordet\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name <namn>   SKRIVER namnet som lagras I "
"tangentbordet (syns för alla värdar):\n"
"                                       förkontroll, säkerhetskopia av "
"nuvarande namn, EN bekräftelse [y/N]\n"
"                                       (--yes hoppar över den och fungerar "
"utan terminal), en skrivning, omedelbar\n"
"                                       återläsning, utlåtande. Inget "
"lösenord i den aktiva lokala sessionen.\n"
"                                       --check: hel förkontroll och "
"säkerhetskopia, inget skrivs, inget frågas\n"
"                                       --dry-run: visar byten, ingen pkexec, "
"inget skrivs\n"
"                                       --verbose: ramar, byte på länken, "
"bevis, [devname]-journal\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --show   namn lagrat i tangentbordet, från "
"tjänstens cache\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --restore <kopia.json> [--yes]   skriv "
"tillbaka en säkerhetskopia (samma flöde)\n"
"Avslutningskoder för --device-name: 0 skrivet och återläst identiskt (eller "
"--check grön), 10 ingen terminal och\n"
"ingen --yes, 11 förkontroll nekad, 12 avbrutet, 13 skrivet men inte återläst "
"(kontrollera med --show),\n"
"14 återläst annorlunda (återställningskommando utskrivet), 15 skrivning "
"osäker (skrivningen misslyckades på vägen:\n"
"en ram kan ha skickats, kontrollera med --show). Beständighet efter "
"batteribyte är inte mätt\n"
"(docs/RENAME-KEYBOARD.md)."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "New alias (max 64 characters, no control characters)"
msgstr "Nytt alias (högst 64 tecken, inga kontrolltecken)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Restore the keyboard's own name"
msgstr "Återställ tangentbordets eget namn"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to rename (default: the one the daemon reports)"
msgstr "Tangentbord att byta namn på (standard: det som tjänsten rapporterar)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Write the name stored IN the keyboard (printable ASCII, 1-32 characters); "
"without a value: with --show or --restore"
msgstr ""
"Skriv namnet som lagras I tangentbordet (utskrivbar ASCII, 1-32 tecken); "
"utan värde: med --show eller --restore"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Do not ask the confirmation (works without a terminal)"
msgstr "Fråga inte efter bekräftelse (fungerar utan terminal)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show the bytes that would be sent, write nothing, no pkexec"
msgstr "Visa byten som skulle skickas, skriv inget, ingen pkexec"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Whole pre-flight (control-channel MTU read via ONE pkexec, read-only) and "
"backup; nothing written, nothing asked"
msgstr ""
"Hel förkontroll (MTU för kontrollkanalen läst via EN pkexec, endast läsning) "
"och säkerhetskopia; inget skrivs, inget frågas"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Accepted for compatibility, no effect: --device-name writes by default"
msgstr ""
"Accepteras för kompatibilitet, ingen effekt: --device-name skriver som "
"standard"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show the name stored in the keyboard (daemon cache, no hardware read)"
msgstr ""
"Visa namnet som lagras i tangentbordet (tjänstens cache, ingen "
"hårdvaruläsning)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Write back a backup made by a previous --device-name run"
msgstr ""
"Skriv tillbaka en säkerhetskopia gjord av en tidigare körning med --device-"
"name"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Byte-by-byte detail (frames, wire, proof, [devname] journal)"
msgstr "Detaljer byte för byte (ramar, länk, bevis, [devname]-journal)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Follow StateChanged signals: one JSON line per change, until interrupted"
msgstr "Följ StateChanged-signaler: en JSON-rad per ändring, tills avbrott"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Battery history (single store: $XDG_STATE_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"history.jsonl)"
msgstr ""
"Batterihistorik (ett enda lager: $XDG_STATE_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"history.jsonl)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Oldest entry: 90m, 24h, 7d, 2w, YYYY-MM-DD or \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\" (UTC)"
msgstr ""
"Äldsta post: 90m, 24h, 7d, 2w, YYYY-MM-DD eller \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\" (UTC)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Newest entry (same formats)"
msgstr "Nyaste post (samma format)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keep only the last N entries"
msgstr "Behåll endast de N senaste posterna"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "JSON array on one line instead of the table"
msgstr "JSON-array på en rad i stället för tabellen"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Export the history on stdout"
msgstr "Exportera historiken till stdout"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "CSV format (the only one; header included)"
msgstr "CSV-format (det enda; med rubrikrad)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Import a history file of the former Python CLI into the single store. The "
"source is not modified; existing lines are not duplicated"
msgstr ""
"Importera en historikfil från det tidigare Python-CLI:t till den enda "
"lagringen. Källan ändras inte; befintliga rader dupliceras inte"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "File to import (history.jsonl of the Python CLI)"
msgstr "Fil att importera (history.jsonl från Python-CLI:t)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Terminal chart of the battery (percentage and voltage) over 24 h or 7 days"
msgstr ""
"Terminaldiagram över batteriet (procent och spänning) för 24 h eller 7 dagar"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Time window"
msgstr "Tidsfönster"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"JSON for a waybar/polybar custom module (classes: good, warning, critical, "
"disconnected)"
msgstr ""
"JSON för en anpassad waybar/polybar-modul (klasser: good, warning, critical, "
"disconnected)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Prometheus text exposition of the keyboard state (one page)"
msgstr "Tangentbordets tillstånd i Prometheus textformat (en sida)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Switch a keyboard LED (NumLock can only be switched off)"
msgstr "Växla en lysdiod på tangentbordet (NumLock kan bara stängas av)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Ask the daemon to send WillShutdown (Feature 0x40, id only) to the keyboard, "
"as macOS does at shutdown: once, only if connected and `[apple] "
"will_shutdown` is on. Run by the shutdown unit"
msgstr ""
"Be tjänsten skicka WillShutdown (Feature 0x40, endast id) till "
"tangentbordet, som macOS gör vid avstängning: en gång, bara om anslutet och "
"`[apple] will_shutdown` är på. Körs av avstängningsenheten"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Do nothing unless the system is shutting down or restarting (`systemctl is-"
"system-running` = stopping): used by the unit, so that a logout or a service "
"restart never sends it"
msgstr ""
"Gör ingenting om inte systemet stängs av eller startas om (`systemctl is-"
"system-running` = stopping): används av enheten så att en utloggning eller "
"omstart av tjänsten aldrig skickar det"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Send HID_CONTROL SUSPEND (0x13) or EXIT_SUSPEND (0x14) to the connected "
"Apple keyboards, as macOS bluetoothd does at sleep and wake: one byte on the "
"HID control channel of bluetoothd, administrator authentication. The system "
"units send it by themselves at every sleep/wake; this is the manual test. --"
"dry-run writes nothing"
msgstr ""
"Skicka HID_CONTROL SUSPEND (0x13) eller EXIT_SUSPEND (0x14) till anslutna "
"Apple-tangentbord, som bluetoothd i macOS gör vid vila och väckning: en byte "
"på bluetoothd:s HID-kontrollkanal, administratörsautentisering. "
"Systemenheterna skickar det själva vid varje vila/väckning; detta är det "
"manuella testet. --dry-run skriver inget"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"suspend: HID_CONTROL SUSPEND, byte 0x13 (what the suspend unit sends before "
"sleep); exit-suspend: HID_CONTROL EXIT_SUSPEND, byte 0x14 (what the resume "
"unit sends at wake)"
msgstr ""
"suspend: HID_CONTROL SUSPEND, byte 0x13 (det som viloenheten skickar före "
"viloläge); exit-suspend: HID_CONTROL EXIT_SUSPEND, byte 0x14 (det som "
"återupptagningsenheten skickar vid uppvaknande)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Only this keyboard (must be a connected Apple keyboard)"
msgstr ""
"Endast det här tangentbordet (måste vara ett anslutet Apple-tangentbord)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Show the bluetoothd socket that would be used (pid, fd, MAC, PSM, state) and "
"send nothing"
msgstr ""
"Visa bluetoothd-uttaget som skulle användas (pid, fd, MAC, PSM, tillstånd) "
"och skicka inget"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Register map of the keyboard (every known HID report: name, size, safety "
"class) with the values the daemon has cached, \"never read\" otherwise. "
"Never reads the keyboard"
msgstr ""
"Registerkarta över tangentbordet (varje känd HID-rapport: namn, storlek, "
"säkerhetsklass) med värdena från tjänstens cache, annars \"aldrig läst\". "
"Läser aldrig tangentbordet"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Machine-readable JSON"
msgstr "Maskinläsbar JSON"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Firmware version of the keyboard against the embedded table of Apple's "
"public firmware updates, where one exists (read once per connection by the "
"daemon; no network, never flashes)"
msgstr ""
"Tangentbordets version av fast programvara jämförd med den inbyggda tabellen "
"över Apples offentliga uppdateringar, där en sådan finns (läses en gång per "
"anslutning av tjänsten; inget nätverk, flashar aldrig)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Read the 3 allowed HID reports (0x47, 0x46, 0x49) with the safe read policy: "
"no scan, never 0x4C / 0xFE / 0x01. Press a key first (an idle keyboard is "
"left alone)"
msgstr ""
"Läs de 3 tillåtna HID-rapporterna (0x47, 0x46, 0x49) med den säkra "
"läspolicyn: ingen skanning, aldrig 0x4C / 0xFE / 0x01. Tryck först på en "
"tangent (ett vilande tangentbord lämnas ifred)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Diagnose the Bluetooth link in one command (BlueZ, pairing, adapter power "
"management, BlueZ/UPower configuration, journal, hidraw, daemon). Read-only "
"unless --fix; run with sudo to also compare the stored and kernel link keys"
msgstr ""
"Diagnostisera Bluetooth-länken med ett kommando (BlueZ, parkoppling, "
"adapterns energisparfunktion, BlueZ/UPower-konfiguration, journal, hidraw, "
"tjänst). Endast läsning om inte --fix; kör med sudo för att även jämföra "
"lagrad nyckel och kärnans länknyckel"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to check (default: the paired one)"
msgstr "Tangentbord att kontrollera (standard: det parkopplade)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Apply the corrections of the system files the diagnostic proposes (BlueZ "
"main.conf, udev rule of the adapter), through the privileged helper: one "
"administrator authentication, the previous file kept as <name>.akm-bak"
msgstr ""
"Tillämpa korrigeringarna av systemfiler som diagnosen föreslår (BlueZ "
"main.conf, adapterns udev-regel) via den privilegierade hjälparen: en "
"administratörsautentisering, föregående fil sparad som <namn>.akm-bak"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "With --fix: show what would change, write nothing (no password)"
msgstr "Med --fix: visa vad som skulle ändras, skriv inget (inget lösenord)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"With --fix: also restart bluetooth / upower so the corrected file is read "
"now (drops every Bluetooth link for a few seconds)"
msgstr ""
"Med --fix: starta även om bluetooth / upower så att den korrigerade filen "
"läses direkt (bryter alla Bluetooth-länkar några sekunder)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "With --fix: also apply the corrections marked \"optional\" (UPower)"
msgstr "Med --fix: tillämpa även korrigeringarna märkta \"valfri\" (UPower)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Guided repair of the link: wake + reconnect first; re-pair only after a "
"typed confirmation (the pairing is never removed otherwise)"
msgstr ""
"Guidad reparation av länken: väckning + återanslutning först; ny parkoppling "
"bara efter en inskriven bekräftelse (annars tas parkopplingen aldrig bort)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to repair (default: the paired one)"
msgstr "Tangentbord att reparera (standard: det parkopplade)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Offer re-pairing even if the link looks healthy"
msgstr "Erbjud ny parkoppling även om länken ser frisk ut"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Effective table of the special keys (F1-F12, Eject; --all: every known key): "
"physical key -> evdev code (after hwdb and hid_apple, per fnmode) -> keysym "
"-> KDE global shortcut. Never reads a key press, except with --live"
msgstr ""
"Faktisk tabell över specialtangenterna (F1-F12, Eject; --all: varje känd "
"tangent): fysisk tangent -> evdev-kod (efter hwdb och hid_apple, per fnmode) "
"-> keysym -> globalt KDE-kortkommando. Läser aldrig ett tangenttryck, utom "
"med --live"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Verdict per key ([ok] = a KDE shortcut is bound) and what to test"
msgstr ""
"Utlåtande per tangent ([ok] = ett KDE-kortkommando är bundet) och vad som "
"ska testas"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "All known keys (modifiers, arrows, Fn...), not only the top row"
msgstr ""
"Alla kända tangenter (modifierare, piltangenter, Fn...), inte bara den "
"översta raden"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Machine-readable JSON (with the KDE actions)"
msgstr "Maskinläsbar JSON (med KDE-åtgärderna)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Live view of the key events of the Apple keyboard instead of the table: HID "
"usage, evdev code, name, one line per press and release. Reads the evdev "
"node (read-only, group \"input\"), records nothing. Leave with Escape held 2 "
"s, or Ctrl-C"
msgstr ""
"Direktvy över Apple-tangentbordets tangenthändelser i stället för tabellen: "
"HID-användning, evdev-kod, namn, en rad per tryck och släpp. Läser evdev-"
