"att hålla Escape i 2 s, eller Ctrl-C"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Manual key mapping without keyd ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"keymap.toml -> udev hwdb, installed with administrator authentication)"
msgstr ""
"Manuell tangentmappning utan keyd ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"keymap.toml -> udev hwdb, installeras med administratörsautentisering)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Show the profiles of keymap.toml (--hwdb: the file `apply` would install)"
msgstr ""
"Visa profilerna i keymap.toml (--hwdb: filen som `apply` skulle installera)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Remap a key: KEY = F1..F12, Eject, Fn, LeftCmd... or a HID usage (0x7003a); "
"CODE = a KEY_* name of linux/input-event-codes.h. Applied by `apply`"
msgstr ""
"Mappa om en tangent: KEY = F1..F12, Eject, Fn, LeftCmd... eller en HID-"
"användning (0x7003a); CODE = ett KEY_*-namn från linux/input-event-codes.h. "
"Tillämpas av `apply`"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Profile to edit (default: the active one)"
msgstr "Profil att redigera (standard: den aktiva)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Back to the kernel mapping for one key (in keymap.toml)"
msgstr "Tillbaka till kärnans mappning för en tangent (i keymap.toml)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Preset of a profile (hid_apple parameters): apple (Apple legend, fnmode=1 "
"swap_opt_cmd=0), fkeys (F1-F12 first, fnmode=2), linux-pc (Cmd<->Alt, "
"swap_opt_cmd=1), none (parameters left as they are, the default)"
msgstr ""
"Förval för en profil (hid_apple-parametrar): apple (Apple-etiketter, "
"fnmode=1 swap_opt_cmd=0), fkeys (F1-F12 först, fnmode=2), linux-pc (Cmd<-"
">Alt, swap_opt_cmd=1), none (parametrarna lämnas som de är, standard)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Select the active profile (created with the apple preset if new)"
msgstr "Välj den aktiva profilen (skapas med förvalet apple om den är ny)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Install the active profile: udev hwdb (akm-helper install-keymap) and "
"hid_apple parameters (akm-helper, persistent, ALL Apple keyboards)"
msgstr ""
"Installera den aktiva profilen: udev hwdb (akm-helper install-keymap) och "
"hid_apple-parametrar (akm-helper, beständigt, ALLA Apple-tangentbord)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show what would change, change nothing"
msgstr "Visa vad som skulle ändras, ändra inget"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Remove the installed hwdb (kernel mapping back at once) and clear the keys "
